== A7  NEW PROVED: Q_n connected for every n >= 14
  n in [5, 200000] with no square in [n+1, 2n-1]: []
  n=5..9 squares in [n+1,2n-1]: {5: [9], 6: [9], 7: [9], 8: [9], 9: [16]}
  n>=10: (sqrt(n+1)+1)^2 = n+2+2sqrt(n+1) <= 2n-1 iff 4(n+1) <= (n-3)^2 iff n^2-10n+5 >= 0, true for n >= 10 (check: [-4, 5]); so vertex n has a neighbour k^2-n in [1, n-1]
  induction: Q_14 connected (A1) and every n >= 15 attaches to an earlier vertex => Q_n connected for all n >= 14.
  the pasted 'N>=25 conjectured connected' is therefore PROVED for all N>=14, not conjectural.

